{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d1832051-5d3f-8156-9401-0122eb600a8b",
  "created_at": "2025-12-11T12:37:48-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Sean Quinn",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:34:52-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:34:55-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Lorraine, good afternoon. My name is Sean Quinn, that's Q-U-I-N-N. I'm calling about trash pickup. I'm at 404 Gidley Street, in the Fifth Ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:35:05-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Mr. Quinn, 404 Gidley Street. What can I help you with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:35:10-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So, I'd like to know the new schedule after the holiday week. Last year, and I want to be exact, it was the year before, 2024, my pickup slid by a day after Christmas, and I put the barrel out a day early. It sat there all weekend. I'd rather not repeat that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:35:30-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, that's smart to ask. Normally the pickup shifts one day later for the holiday week. Let me look at what's posted for your street. What's your regular day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:35:41-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Regular day is Monday. Trash Monday, recycling every other Monday. Well, correction, recycling was last Monday, the eighth, so the next one would be the twenty-second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:35:51-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so trash Monday, recycling last on the eighth. Let me pull that up. [pause] Alright, I'm seeing that the holiday shift affects the week of Christmas. So your Monday the twenty-second stays as is, but the following Monday, the twenty-ninth, I'm not seeing it clearly in what I have in front of me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:36:11-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hm. So the twenty-second is normal, and the twenty-ninth is the question mark."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:36:17-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, the twenty-ninth. Let me read that back. Gidley Street, Monday pickup, normal on the twenty-second, and you want to confirm the twenty-ninth and the first of January week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:36:28-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly. And honestly, Lorraine, I'd like a supervisor to call me back with the final word, if that's possible. Not because of anything you did. I'd just like it from someone who can say for certain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:36:42-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course. I can put in a request for a supervisor to call you. What's the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:36:49-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0188. That's a landline, so it's home. I'm here evenings, and today, Thursday, I'm home till about, oh, one-fifteen, then I'm out until five."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:36:59-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. 401-555-0188, evenings are best, and I'll note you're home until one-fifteen today. I'll mark it for the holiday schedule on Gidley Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:37:09-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Sorry, I'm a little scattered today. I signed up to chaperone a school dance, Friday the nineteenth, and I regret it already. I said yes in a weak moment at pickup."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:37:21-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's a long night. Hopefully the music isn't too loud."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:37:26-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll bring earplugs. Anyway, thank you. So, to confirm, a supervisor calls me at 401-555-0188 about the schedule for the twenty-ninth."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:37:35-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right, Mr. Quinn. Someone will call you back about the holiday-week pickup at 404 Gidley."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:37:42-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wonderful. Thanks again, Lorraine. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:37:46-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye now."
    }
  ],
